---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Studio"
  description="Harikita Studio is a husband-and-wife studio: she draws, he builds."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <p class="text-eyebrow uppercase text-ink-muted">The studio</p>

    <h1 class="mt-5 text-hero">
      Two names,<br />
      <span class="font-script text-[1.12em] font-normal text-primary">one studio.</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-body">
      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold">Harikita</strong> is not an invented brand
        name. It is <strong class="font-semibold">Haris</strong> and
        <strong class="font-semibold">Rezkita</strong> — the two of us, from our
        own wedding. In Indonesian, <em>kita</em> means “we”. The name says
        “our story” twice over, which is why we kept it.
      </p>
      <p class="text-ink-muted">
        She draws. He builds the thing that carries the artwork to your
        guests. That division is the whole studio: one person protecting the
        artwork, one person keeping the technology out of its way.
      </p>
      <p class="text-ink-muted">
        We accept a small number of commissions each month. Not because of
        scarcity marketing — because a finished illustration takes the time it takes, and a
        hobby should stay a pleasure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 border-t border-line pt-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-eyebrow uppercase text-ink-muted">The artist</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-caption text-ink-muted">
          Illustration, colour and composition. Every piece is drawn for one
          couple, never reused.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-eyebrow uppercase text-ink-muted">The builder</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-caption text-ink-muted">
          A fast, quiet website. No RSVP forms, no dashboards, no feature that
          competes with the artwork.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <Button href="/commission">Commission a piece</Button>
      <Button href="/portfolio" variant="secondary">See the collection</Button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>